  "caption": {
    "en": "A buy stop at 1.0960 triggers when price breaks the range high. The break is brief, price falls back inside the range, and the stop at 1.0930 is hit.",
    "bn": "1.0960-এ buy stop range high ভাঙলে চালু হয়। ভাঙন ক্ষণস্থায়ী, দাম range-এর ভেতরে ফিরে আসে, 1.0930-এর stop লাগে।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A stop entry guarantees you are in once price breaks out, including when the breakout fails.",
    "bn": "Stop entry breakout হলেই আপনাকে ঢোকায়, breakout ব্যর্থ হলেও।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Breakout orders fill on false breakouts too",
      "bn": "Breakout order ভুয়া breakout-এও fill হয়"
    }
  ],
